@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Original no-concept V2 owner records
+
+Captured independently from fixed `7a6a8a2a0cc4dca86abd437bd7cd532423a48167` using the actual local HTTP create/PATCH/Review/synthetic human/publication owners. The original text has no concepts and two ordered explicit dependencies. Its base is `draft-base-material-dependencies-v2` with a complete original dependency witness.
+
+The 11 manifest-listed files and original manifest are exact bytes. Five records were read from actual synthetic SQLite owner rows and checked against their stored digest and canonical bytes. The three HTTP ACK bodies were obtained by real original-command replay, with unchanged table hashes. No database, headers or credentials are included; all material and decisions are synthetic software fixtures.
+
+Keep these files unchanged. Contract tests parse/canonicalize the old records, preserve their hashes and render ACKs to these independent raw bodies. This is a cross-version representation oracle, not a claim of reopening the original capture database with new code. Current integration tests separately exercise the real new-code HTTP replay path. The existing `draft_edit_legacy_v1` oracle remains separate and unchanged.
